{"id":"n29683-1-2","stage":1,"title":"그때 · 那时","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29683-1-2-1","ko":"지난번에 본 영화 참 재미있었지?","zh":"上次看的那个电影真的很好看对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난번에","meaning":"上次，上回","explanation":"지난번：上次，上回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71316","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난번에","audio":"/audio/00bddae7b7dbaea35dd2.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있었지?","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있었지","audio":"/audio/4979e2f0fb97c0f04212.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0c2f1df517822c1f","term":"지난번","zh":"上次，上回","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3","entryId":"71316","definition":"以正在说话时为准，指过去的时候。","pronunciation":["지난번"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/697d5ece1904d677ffe8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29683-1-2-2","ko":"맞아. 그때 본 영화 제목이 뭐지?","zh":"对啊。那时候看的电影叫什么来着？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"그때","meaning":"那时，那时候","explanation":"그때：那时，那时候。","readings":[{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29683","senseId":"1","lemma":"그때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1"